は、「令和６年１１月８日午後１１時頃、Ｈ市内の路上でＶを見掛け、声を掛けようとしたところ、知らない男がＶに近付いた。Ｖは、その男に向かって『④甲、何の用だ。』と言った。その直後、その男がＶに刃物のようなものを突き刺して逃げていった。」と証言した。Ｃは、「令和６年１１月９日午前１０時頃、自宅において、甲から『⑤昨日午後１１時頃は、俺はＩ市内をドライブしていた。』と言われた。」と証言した。"}],"sub_questions":[],"requires_context":true,"choices":[{"number":1,"text":"ア エ","labels":["ア","エ"]},{"number":2,"text":"ア オ","labels":["ア","オ"]},{"number":3,"text":"イ ウ","labels":["イ","ウ"]},{"number":4,"text":"イ エ","labels":["イ","エ"]},{"number":5,"text":"ウ オ","labels":["ウ","オ"]}],"answer_slots":[{"no":33,"official_answer":1}],"scoring":{"partial_credit":null,"no_partial_credit":false,"raw_note":""},"status":{"voided":false,"all_correct":false,"errata":[]},"statements":["yobi-2025-keiso-q23-a","yobi-2025-keiso-q23-b","yobi-2025-keiso-q23-c","yobi-2025-keiso-q23-d","yobi-2025-keiso-q23-e"],"statement_truth_derivable":true,"provenance":{"question_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/R07-2025/刑法刑事訴訟法_問題.pdf","answer_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/R07-2025/刑法刑事訴訟法_正答.pdf","page":21,"line_range":[680,713],"extraction":"pdftotext"},"flags":[]},{"id":"yobi-2025-keiso-q24","exam":{"type":"yobi","year":2025,"era":"R07"},"subject":"keiso","number":24,"points":2,"format":"combination","polarity":null,"exhaustive":false,"unordered":false,"stem":"捜査機関の権限行使に関する次のアからオまでの各記述のうち、適法となる余地のないものの組合せは、後記１から５までのうちどれか。（解答欄は、［№34］）","context":[],"sub_questions":[],"requires_context":false,"choices":[{"number":1,"text":"ア イ","labels":["ア","イ"]},{"number":2,"text":"ア オ","labels":["ア","オ"]},{"number":3,"text":"イ エ","labels":["イ","エ"]},{"number":4,"text":"ウ エ","labels":["ウ","エ"]},{"number":5,"text":"ウ オ","labels":["ウ","オ"]}],"answer_slots":[{"no":34,"official_answer":5}],"scoring":{"partial_credit":null,"no_partial_credit":false,"raw_note":""},"status":{"voided":false,"all_correct":false,"errata":[]},"statements":["yobi-2025-keiso-q24-a","yobi-2025-keiso-q24-b","yobi-2025-keiso-q24-c","yobi-2025-keiso-q24-d","yobi-2025-keiso-q24-e"],"statement_truth_derivable":false,"provenance":{"question_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/R07-2025/刑法